<title>ESTONIA: ESTIKO STARTS CERTIFICATES TRADING.</title>
<headline>ESTIKO STARTS CERTIFICATES TRADING.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estiko will begin trading in share subscription certificates from today, the Tallinn stock exchange said on Friday.</p>
<p>Until the share captial increase has been entered into the business register, trading in the certificates will be under a seperate name from the existing stock's name.</p>
<p>The minimum of certificates that can be traded is 100 securities, the stock exchange said in a statement.</p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
